  "title": "Namaz e Mayyat",
  "data": "After the first Takbir, say:\nاَشْهَدُ اَنْ لَّاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللّٰهُ وَ اَشْهَدُ اَنَّ مُحَمَّدًا رَّسُوْلُ اللّٰهِ\nASH-HADU AL LAA ILAAHA ILLALLAAHU WA ASH-HADU ANNA MUHAMMADAR RASOOLULLAAH\nI bear witness that there is no god save Allah, and I bear witness that Muhammad is the Messenger of Allah.\nAfter the second Takbir, say the Salawat:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nO Allah, send blessings upon Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad.\nAfter the third Takbir, pray for the faithful believers:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اغْفِرْ لِلْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ وَ الْمُؤْمِنَاتِ\nALLAAHUMMAGH-FIR LIL-MOO'MINEENA WAL MOO'MINAAT\nO Allah, forgive the believing men and the believing women.\nAfter the fourth Takbir, pray for the deceased:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اغْفِرْ لِهٰذَا الْمَيِّتِ\nALLAAHUMMAGH-FIR LI-HAADHAL MAYYIT\nO Allah, forgive this deceased person.\nThen recite the fifth Takbir and conclude the prayer.",
  "merits": "The Deceased Prayer (Salat al-Mayyit) consists of five Takbirs (saying Allahu Akbar). After each Takbir, a specific supplication is recited as follows:"
}
